1
00:00:00,606 --> 00:00:03,646
(Sheldon:)...of never interfering
in your personal affairs.

2
00:00:06,445 --> 00:00:08,865
(Leonard:)Yes, I've always admired that
about you.

3
00:00:09,031 --> 00:00:10,161
(Sheldon:)As well you should.

4
00:00:10,324 --> 00:00:12,574
(Sheldon:)But I'm going to make
an exception here.

5
00:00:12,743 --> 00:00:14,243
(Leonard:)Oh, good.

6
00:00:14,411 --> 00:00:18,581
(Sheldon:)Priya has moved back to India
to pursue her law career.

7
00:00:18,749 --> 00:00:24,379
(Sheldon:)Instead of desperately trying to keep
this intercontinental relationship alive...

8
00:00:24,546 --> 00:00:28,426
(Sheldon:)...you could use that time
to take up a hobby.

9
00:00:30,177 --> 00:00:31,887
- A hobby?
- Yes.

10
00:00:32,054 --> 00:00:38,814
(Sheldon:)I read recently about a fellow in Kansas
with an enormous ball of twine.

11
00:00:39,978 --> 00:00:42,898
(Sheldon:)I bet you could give him
a run for his money.

12
00:00:43,315 --> 00:00:45,485
(Leonard:)You know, some people might say...

13
00:00:45,651 --> 00:00:48,361
(Leonard:)...that it's great that we're trying
to make things work.

14
00:00:48,529 --> 00:00:52,619
They'd say things like, "Love is stronger
than the miles between you."

15
00:00:52,783 --> 00:00:58,023
(Sheldon:)When I rise to power,
those people will be sterilized.

